  "metric_defense": "In recruitment screening, class imbalance means negative samples (non-matches) heavily dominate. While recruiters care about high Precision (minimizing false positives to avoid wasted interviews), a pure focus on precision risks discarding qualified candidates (false negatives). For CareerCompass, which provides constructive guidance and improvement plans, Balanced F1-Score is the most critical metric because it penalizes both false positive recommendations and false negative rejections."
